# Generic JSON-in/JSON-out request to inmoov_memory's memory_node.
# request_json/response_json carry a free-form JSON payload; the exact
# schema (an "op" field plus op-specific arguments) is defined by memory_node — see
# inmoov_memory/README.md for the request/response formats it supports.

string request_json
---
string response_json
bool success
